abstract: "Arabic place names for the 22 member states of the League of Arab States from GeoNames (files of 2026-10-30) and Wikidata (dump of 2026-10-26): 246,637 places with Arabic and Latin-script name variants in spelling clusters, admin paths and 52,257 place-matching examples. Contains data from GeoNames (CC BY 4.0) and Wikidata (CC0)."
